[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/khoi0102/efr-workshop-art/main/poster.jpg?v=3[/img]

[h1]53 modern firearms. 141 real attachments. One gunsmith.[/h1]
Arm your colonists like a special-operations team. Every gun can be stripped and rebuilt part by part, and every part you fit is drawn on the gun, on the ground and in your colonist's hands.

[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/khoi0102/efr-workshop-art/main/panel_glance.png?v=3[/img]

[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/khoi0102/efr-workshop-art/main/h_gunsmith.png?v=1[/img]
[img]https://images.steamusercontent.com/ugc/15943831446374735094/720220308C4B66D054FD12F57AB8759151A35856/[/img]
[list]
[*]Select a colonist holding one of these guns and press the [b]Gunsmith[/b] button.
[*]A colonist fetches the part from your stockpile, works on the gun and fits it. Parts you take off go back to the stockpile.
[*]Every change updates range, aim time, recoil, accuracy, weight, value and hunting stealth, and you see the numbers before you commit.
[*]Suppressed guns use their own quiet gunshot sound.
[*][b]Auto mods[/b] fits a meta build in one click: least recoil and best handling for the gun's role. Works in [b]EdB Prepare Carefully[/b] for your starting guns.
[*][b]Strip All Mods[/b] takes everything off in one click.
[/list]

[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/khoi0102/efr-workshop-art/main/h_fits.png?v=1[/img]
[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/khoi0102/efr-workshop-art/main/panel_slots.png?v=3[/img]
Each gun only takes parts that fit the real thing. AK magazines go in AKs, AR-15 stocks need a buffer tube, and a bolt-action rifle takes its own magazines. Every part's description lists the guns it fits.
[list]
[*][b]Chassis / body slot:[/b] chassis conversions rebuild the M1A (SAGE EBR, ProMag Archangel) and the OP-SKS (FAB Defense UAS, TAPCO Intrafuse); their rails open the foregrip and laser slots.
[*]Iron sights are hidden when an optic is fitted.
[/list]
[img]https://images.steamusercontent.com/ugc/9605574711581673017/306087FAC2ED8B8BDD8BFD4F43F0D601C713F673/[/img]

[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/khoi0102/efr-workshop-art/main/h_build.png?v=1[/img]
[img]https://images.steamusercontent.com/ugc/16942111348307627239/90C4514BD2CD2BD5CC4032925E352423AFDA5B59/[/img]

[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/khoi0102/efr-workshop-art/main/h_arsenal.png?v=1[/img]
[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/khoi0102/efr-workshop-art/main/catalog.jpg?v=3[/img]
[b]Pistols (5):[/b] FN Five-seveN, Glock 18C, HK USP .45, Desert Eagle Mk XIX, Beretta M9A3
[b]Submachine guns (6):[/b] HK MP5, HK MP7A2, FN P90, HK UMP45, KRISS Vector, SIG MPX
[b]Assault and battle rifles (23):[/b] Colt M4A1 SOPMOD I, HK416A5, FN SCAR-L and SCAR-H, HK G36, Steyr AUG A1 and A3, DT MDR 5.56 and 7.62, SIG MCX-SPEAR and M7, CMMG Mk47, CGNL NL545 DI and GP, AK-74M, AK-12, AKM, AK-103, AKS-74U, AS VAL, AS VAL MOD.4, ASh-12, DSA SA-58
[b]Marksman rifles (6):[/b] KAC SR-25, HK G28, R11 RSASS, Springfield M1A, VSS Vintorez, OP-SKS
[b]Sniper rifles (7):[/b] Barrett Mk 22, AI AXMC, Sako TRG M10, ORSIS T-5000M, Lobaev DVL-10, Remington M700, SV-98
[b]Machine guns and shotguns (6):[/b] M60E6, PKM, RPD, Remington 870, Saiga-12K, Benelli M3 Super 90

Each gun is balanced against the others in its class by real-world handling, range, fire rate and ammunition.

[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/khoi0102/efr-workshop-art/main/h_getting.png?v=1[/img]
[img]https://images.steamusercontent.com/ugc/18064811652241686852/882DDEBE3DAE61EC532A90473D63FA1DE0062603/[/img]
[list]
[*][b]Armory bench:[/b] a new work table (research Gunsmithing, 150 steel and 4 components, needs power). All guns and parts are made here.
[*][b]Research:[/b] Gunsmithing and Precision Rifling unlock the first guns, then SOPMOD tactical modifications, next-gen battle rifles, and DMR and sniper systems.
[*][b]Trade and loot:[/b] traders sell them, and raiders carry them in meta builds or with random attachments.
[/list]

