[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/khoi0102/efr-workshop-art/main/h_faq.png?v=1[/img]
[b]Where is the Gunsmith button?[/b]
Select a colonist holding one of these guns. It sits next to Draft and Fire at will.

[b]Why can't I put this part on my gun?[/b]
It doesn't fit that gun. The part's description lists every gun it fits.

[b]Can I use the parts on guns from other mods?[/b]
No, only on this mod's guns.

