All art, textures and code in this mod are my own work.
[list]
[*]Do not reupload this mod, in whole or in part, on Steam or anywhere else.
[*]Do not use its art, textures or code in other mods or projects without my permission.
[*]Adding it to a Steam collection that links to this page is fine.
[*]Want to make a patch, translation or add-on? Ask me in the comments first.
[/list]

[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/khoi0102/efr-workshop-art/main/h_support.png?v=1[/img]
